{"3154550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aegis Force: The Scorian War", "steam_appid": 3154550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/8d8aa66d4ff2b5aee6a931dd7f8bfbff.avif?t=1788188449\" width=596 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b3b877093c45b280a65417a0780bcbb5.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/a6c91fc25e8f7c40edf8faa3a154bafc.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aegis Force: The Scorian War is a <strong>turn-based tactical RPG</strong> inspired by such classics in the genre as Shining Force, Fire Emblem, and Final Fantasy Tactics. Players will follow the main protagonists, Callon Roth and Orvus Magnaric, as they fight as heroic soldiers in the Genuan army during the long-lasting and embittering Scorian War. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights of the game include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captures the essence of genre-defining pixel art JRPG classics with colorful pixel art 2.5D visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blends turn-based strategic combat with <i>full world and town exploration</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contains a character-driven morally complex story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offers players an intricately detailed world with secrets to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/4a7c352718ce0464e8e4cf70ffb502c4.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b8a18138c4a043679284a4767f50cd6f.poster.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b8a18138c4a043679284a4767f50cd6f.webm?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b8a18138c4a043679284a4767f50cd6f.mp4?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/177abdf74fb0a7b510e21fa6660961fc.poster.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/177abdf74fb0a7b510e21fa6660961fc.webm?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/177abdf74fb0a7b510e21fa6660961fc.mp4?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical victory or agonizing defeat… The choice is yours</strong> —</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through the continent of Ianua with your force of heroes in tactical combat encounters that take place on a grid, reminiscent of games such as Fire Emblem, Final Fantasy Tactics and Shining Force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As Callon, use the powers of a Tactimagus to make every move count. Utilize a myriad of spells, attacks, and abilities across your ever-expanding team to forge your victory across dozens of increasingly complex strategic battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battler together with other members of your force to build up your bond, then unlock and employ devastating tach attacks together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/644e505262f9f5a4a087e6c30f87e4c0.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/6f1e9fe481fbcdffdede4c5c35c2f5d2.poster.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/6f1e9fe481fbcdffdede4c5c35c2f5d2.webm?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/6f1e9fe481fbcdffdede4c5c35c2f5d2.mp4?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aegis Force blends full world and town exploration as seen with classic golden era JRPGs, but once a player engages in combat, they will fight in place on a grid in turn-based tactical battle mode. This gives new strategic depth to the classic JRPG formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/73479379c732bd3b15df088934c38ef0.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 15 recruitable characters </strong>— Grow your force by locating and recruiting new members during your journey across the continent and through unique and exciting locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize your force </strong>— Promote and customize your characters and their abilities, then choose which ones to include in your force based on your preferred tactical strategies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/31ed6e606a198ee1d3a70d30cc7ca19e.poster.avif?t=1788188449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/31ed6e606a198ee1d3a70d30cc7ca19e.webm?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/31ed6e606a198ee1d3a70d30cc7ca19e.mp4?t=1788188449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Callon Roth, Orvus Magnaric, and Vedette Kairn, three childhood friends-turned-soldiers in this 2.5D Strategy RPG adventure as they recruit a varied cast of 15+ warriors, thieves, mages, engineers, and more to plan heists, battle monsters, uncover ancient weapons, foil dark plots, and unlock the mysteries of a continent caught in a century-long struggle  with the heart of your favorite stories from the 16 and 32-bit eras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotionally-driven cinematic storytelling</strong> — A 30-hour story-driven single-player adventure awaits you as you journey across the great continent of Ianua. Join Callon and his friends as they uncover enemies and allies, tackle surprising challenges, and deal with the machinations of powerful figures dead set on reshaping the future in their image, and see how your characters and their relationships grow during their journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A pixel art 2.5d  world full of fascinating creatures</strong> — Lead your characters through a unique pixel art 2.5d world full of races, creatures, and monstrosities as they journey down unexpected paths. You may be surprised where you end up as you forge unforeseen alliances that could either lead you to the end of The Scorian War… or the end of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two countries — one empowered by magic, the other by technology — have been at war for 100 years with no end in sight… but nobody seems to remember how it began. Will you fight to discover the truth? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up your sword and embark on an unforgettable adventure with Callon and the Aegis Force to end the Scorian War and bring peace to the continent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/cee086120989adee2fecd7f0cb3d6a15.avif?t=1788188449\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras_big/cee086120989adee2fecd7f0cb3d6a15.avif?t=1788188449 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/8d8aa66d4ff2b5aee6a931dd7f8bfbff.avif?t=1788188449\" width=596 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b3b877093c45b280a65417a0780bcbb5.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/a6c91fc25e8f7c40edf8faa3a154bafc.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aegis Force: The Scorian War is a <strong>turn-based tactical RPG</strong> inspired by such classics in the genre as Shining Force, Fire Emblem, and Final Fantasy Tactics. Players will follow the main protagonists, Callon Roth and Orvus Magnaric, as they fight as heroic soldiers in the Genuan army during the long-lasting and embittering Scorian War. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights of the game include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captures the essence of genre-defining pixel art JRPG classics with colorful pixel art 2.5D visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blends turn-based strategic combat with <i>full world and town exploration</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contains a character-driven morally complex story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offers players an intricately detailed world with secrets to discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/4a7c352718ce0464e8e4cf70ffb502c4.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154550/extras/b8a18138c4a043679284a4767f50cd6f.poster.avif?t=1788188449\" width=680 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared